sequenceDiagram
    participant C as [Client] Client
    participant U as [Server] Uvicorn
    participant SM as [Middleware] ServerErrorMiddleware
    participant EM as [Middleware] ExceptionMiddleware
    participant CM as [Middleware] CORS / Custom Middleware
    participant R as [Router] APIRouter
    participant D as [DI] solve_dependencies()
    participant V as [Validator] Pydantic
    participant E as [Endpoint] Path Operation

    C->>U: HTTP Request
    U->>SM: ASGI scope, receive, send
    SM->>EM: Pass through error handling
    EM->>CM: Pass through exception handling
    CM->>CM: Process middleware (CORS, etc.)
    CM->>R: Route matching (path + method)

    R->>R: Match APIRoute by URL pattern
    R->>D: solve_dependencies(route.dependant)

    Note over D: Build dependency tree<br/>from function signature

    D->>D: get_dependant(endpoint)<br/>Extract path/query/header/cookie/body params
    D->>D: get_flat_dependant()<br/>Flatten nested dependencies

    loop Each dependency in tree
        D->>D: Check cache (use_cache=True)
        D->>V: Validate dependency parameters
        V-->>D: Validated values
        D->>D: Call dependency function
        D->>D: Handle yield dependencies<br/>(AsyncExitStack)
    end

    D->>V: Validate request body with Pydantic
    V-->>D: Validated body
    D-->>R: Solved values dict

    R->>E: Call endpoint function<br/>with solved dependencies
    E->>V: Serialize return value (Pydantic)
    V-->>E: JSON-serializable response

    alt BackgroundTasks
        E->>E: Schedule background tasks
    end

    E-->>R: Response object
    R-->>CM: Response
    CM->>CM: Process response middleware
    CM-->>EM: Response
    EM-->>SM: Response
    SM-->>U: Response
    U-->>C: HTTP Response

    Note over D: Cleanup yield dependencies<br/>(exit AsyncExitStack)
